  "bio": "Embrace the timeless elegance of monochrome ink at ARTISAN, an award-winning tattoo studio nestled in the heart of Pittsburgh. Renowned for their mastery in black and gray tattoo art, this creative haven doubles as a local artist gallery, fostering a vibrant atmosphere where ink and artistry converge. Visit us Tuesday through Saturday, from 10 am to 8 pm, and experience the embodiment of skill and passion on skin. (Note: for consultation, please reach out through proper channels as we are unable to respond to DMs.)\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, United States\n\n⛓️Private Tattoo Studio in Pittsburgh, PA ⛓️\n@jasonangst @rosabeltattoos @_necro.raven.art_ \n⛓️‍💥 BOOK WITH US ⛓️‍💥",
